OL,3,ABritish Crown symbol was branded on
OL,4,Aenslaved Africans, research finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnslaved African people were branded
OL,7,Fwith an identifying mark that included
OL,8,Fan emblem of the British Crown,
OL,9,Faccording to new research by a project
OL,10,Fdocumenting British involvement in the
OL,11,Fslave trade.
OL,13,FProf William Pettigrew, who led the
OL,14,FRegister of British Slave Traders
OL,15,Fresearch, described the imprinting as a
OL,16,F"dramatic and harrowing" symbol of the
OL,17,Fmonarchy's relationship to slavery.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
