OL,3,ABritish Crown symbol was branded on
OL,4,Aenslaved Africans, research finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe register lists 13,000 individuals
OL,7,Fand hundreds of institutions known to
OL,8,Fhave invested in Britain's role in
OL,9,Fslavery between 1563 and 1807, when the
OL,10,Ftrade was abolished across the British
OL,11,FEmpire.
OL,13,FResearchers say it is the most
OL,14,Fcomprehensive examination of a national
OL,15,Fcommunity of slave traders ever
OL,16,Fundertaken.
